			icon: "ae2:pattern_provider"
			description: ["Bram: \"A box that knows what's in every other box is a list. A box that refills them is a works.\"", "", "Encode 8 Crafting Patterns at the Pattern Encoding Terminal, then hold 2 Pattern Providers and 2 Level Emitters and wire them to the pantry chest in the inn — emitter low, provider pushes, pantry never empties.", "", "Marnie stops counting bread, and the Delivery Crate starts filling itself for the eight dinners."]
