			title: "Cut the Rig Pad and Run the Power Lane"
			subtitle: "Legal to build. Not yet legal to run."
			icon: "quarryplus:flex_marker"
			description: ["Tobin: \"The site's surveyed, so the pad is mine to cut. The rig isn't mine to switch on until the town says so. Different problems.\"", "", "Level the 9x9 pad on the site the deep survey picked and run Energy Duct from the reactor grid out to it, then set the Flexible Marker on the corner stake and type the box — a side of 64 is well inside this pack's 256 cap.", "", "Pad cut and duct run: that is the whole rig but the Deed. The Flexible Marker types the box and four spare Markers hold its corners."]
