		{
			id: "01FC364C89D2C630"
			title: "Cook Each Resident's Favourite Dish"
			subtitle: "Eight plates, eight people."
			icon: "farmersdelight:roast_chicken"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Eight plates, eight people. The crate by the counter already has every ingredient in it — your network saw to that.\"", "", "Cook one each: Roast Chicken for Marnie, Beef Stew for Bram, Cabbage Rolls for Oda, Fish Stew for Nella, Mushroom Rice for Halden, Bacon and Eggs for Tobin, Fruit Salad for Wisp, Sweet Berry Cheesecake for Pip. Hold all eight at hand-in.", "", "You keep the Feast Crate: one of each, set aside for Founder's Day."]
