			title: "Hang the Copper Bell on the Marked Post"
			subtitle: "Pip has already named it Big Copper."
			icon: "minecraft:bell"
			description: ["Pip: \"I get to ring it, and I already named it! It's called Big Copper!\"", "", "Cast one Bell from the quarry's own copper — a copper block ringed by four copper ingots at any bench — and hang it on the marked post in the finished square.", "", "Every resident comes out for it. Pip has been the courier since December; from today he has the bell rope and nobody is getting it off him."]
			x: 16.0d
