			subtitle: "The last lamp."
			icon: "minecraft:lantern"
			description: ["Josie, on the last page: \"There's a lamp post on my porch with nothing on it. I'd like to be on the line.\"", "", "Walk up to Josie's porch and put one Lantern on the bare post — the only one on the whole road that never got lit. There are twenty-four in your bag from the road work.", "", "Forty lamps. Fifteen people. One winter that nobody leaves."]
